Package: dsFlower
Type: Package
Title: DataSHIELD Server-Side Integration for Flower Federated Learning
Version: 0.4.5
Authors@R: c(
    person("David", "Sarrat González", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "david.sarrat@isglobal.org"),
    person("Juan R", "González", role = "aut", email = "juanr.gonzalez@isglobal.org"))
Description: Server-side DataSHIELD package that runs Flower federated learning
    through a node-installed, hash-pinned runner with server-authoritative
    differential privacy. Provides server-pinned per-training privacy contracts,
    sticky cryptographic randomness, declarative DP-SGD training, private
    model validation, and a fail-closed sandbox gate for untrusted hook code. Raw data
    remains on the node; exact feature statistics, node logs, metrics, and cohort
    weights are not released through DataSHIELD.
